{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-8-11","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平方与比例与整数","englishTitle":"Between two square numbers there is one mean proportional number, and the square has to the square the ratio duplicate of that which the side has to the side.","book":8,"number":11,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.11","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.11/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":11,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-8-11@raw-96dce51e2d4e1fbd","contentId":"euclid-8-11","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"96dce51e2d4e1fbd2d2172fa566629d792b1f8573fd29a46945499055e3b990a","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-8-11.statement","euclid-8-11.construction.1","euclid-8-11.construction.2","euclid-8-11.proof.1","euclid-8-11.proof.2","euclid-8-11.proof.3","euclid-8-11.proof.4","euclid-8-11.proof.5","euclid-8-11.proof.6","euclid-8-11.proof.7","euclid-8-11.proof.8","euclid-8-11.proof.9","euclid-8-11.conclusion","euclid-8-11.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-8-11.statement","contentId":"euclid-8-11","revisionId":"euclid-8-11@raw-96dce51e2d4e1fbd","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"af7b863d048be51a0b672548ecfaa37f4cce12fe37e889210ecacae5def37cd8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Between two square numbers there is one mean proportional number, and the square has to the square the ratio duplicate of that which the side has to the side."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在2 平方数之间,有1 比例中项个数字,平方数个数字与平方数个数字的比是重复的,而这一比是一方与另一方之间的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-11.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-8-11","revisionId":"euclid-8-11@raw-96dce51e2d4e1fbd","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"46bd8e60bfddb1f0cf1d66ea6aa0a9acf5a5a93b9154a613584dc3fafced7e27","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be square numbers, and let C be the side of A, and D of B; I say that between A, B there is one mean proportional number, and A has to B the ratio duplicate of that which C has to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B是平方数,让C站在A,B站在B的一边;我说,A,B中间有一个比例中项,A,A与C的比例重复到B,C与D的比例相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-11.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-8-11","revisionId":"euclid-8-11@raw-96dce51e2d4e1fbd","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e3349974ec4680451af46f4d3091962f018bf5ef7fe5e6218208965e1c3c9640","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let C by multiplying D make E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C和D的产物是E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-11.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-8-11","revisionId":"euclid-8-11@raw-96dce51e2d4e1fbd","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d416678f6975af577f15b210ca04893ff0aa6b9656975f988fa06b6f08a3800f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since A is a square and C is its side, therefore C by multiplying itself has made A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,A是平方数,C是它的一面, 因此C乘以本身就已经达到A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-11.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-8-11","revisionId":"euclid-8-11@raw-96dce51e2d4e1fbd","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"07205cac4ed37da9727659234de5643cdd484c0aaeaf4017af82478adb2e6aec","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason also D by multiplying itself has made B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,D乘以乘以本身,就已达B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-11.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-8-11","revisionId":"euclid-8-11@raw-96dce51e2d4e1fbd","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"424099c8a3a7d53e61e2ee221c31e553cbca09c1b0fd2d43b0d1859ee9fb52a8","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then C by multiplying the numbers C, D has made A, E respectively, therefore, as C is to D, so is A to E. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,C乘以C,D分别达到A,E,C与D的比等于A与E的比；C 与 D 之比等于 A 与 E 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-11.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-8-11","revisionId":"euclid-8-11@raw-96dce51e2d4e1fbd","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"38ba21dc84913a6a08ff01efff0e9e01d209bf7d36def2337da5aa1a7515be77","citations":["euclid-7-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason also, as C is to D, so is E to B. [[VII. 18](/principles/euclid-7-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,C比D的比例等于E比B；C 与 D 之比等于 E 与 B 之比。 [[VII. 18](/principles/euclid-7-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-11.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-8-11","revisionId":"euclid-8-11@raw-96dce51e2d4e1fbd","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7135812d7f2302f738ab4c304d3337f78783966ba0cff67ceddf7accd02ebc1d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, as A is to E, so is E to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A对E的比也等于E对B的比；A 与 E 之比等于 E 与 B 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-11.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-8-11","revisionId":"euclid-8-11@raw-96dce51e2d4e1fbd","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6fa0b6cf4a6b9b1643d1865954a1e1df99c395ef098d1b812aecc399b9fe26ae","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore between A, B there is one mean proportional number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A,B之间 有一个比例中项的数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-11.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-8-11","revisionId":"euclid-8-11@raw-96dce51e2d4e1fbd","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"264abafcddb996f095b01f81e896509a4fe7e8d39e0132da0c667add31173907","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that A also has to B the ratio duplicate of that which C has to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我说,A的比例也与C的比例(D)的比例重复到B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-11.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-8-11","revisionId":"euclid-8-11@raw-96dce51e2d4e1fbd","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"89d9b99c0366a5eb48c72362fecc57f916dde56475d2ee0393659ed00bf0e263","citations":["euclid-5-def-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A, E, B are three numbers in proportion, therefore A has to B the ratio duplicate of that which A has to E. [[V. Def. 9](/principles/euclid-5-def-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于A以来,E,B是三个数字,因此A比B是重复,A比E。 [[V. Def. 9](/principles/euclid-5-def-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-11.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-8-11","revisionId":"euclid-8-11@raw-96dce51e2d4e1fbd","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5f0ab98d2f40bb8c02273ff51aae6390691da7b452b3d28eac41e0ab572e7ecd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as A is to E, so is C to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,A比E的比等于C比D；A 与 E 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-11.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-8-11","revisionId":"euclid-8-11@raw-96dce51e2d4e1fbd","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4a3b97bf64aa0713b18718f2e810443114f10b0376179cb218490e04f7bd782c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A has to B the ratio duplicate of that which the side C has to D. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A比B比C比D比Q比E比D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-11.source","contentId":"euclid-8-11","revisionId":"euclid-8-11@raw-96dce51e2d4e1fbd","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"539694c9054abbe7fbfbf6473b1e0006597fef1bb3d21fb9bfaf8e7c1afda914","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.11/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.pro